# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
# Allow-list: the build context is exactly what docker/Dockerfile and
# docker/Dockerfile.analyzers COPY. Everything else (dev venvs, coverage and
# shard output, local analyzer caches, .env files, .ignorelocal) never reaches
# the builder. Add a path here when a Dockerfile starts COPYing it.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!scripts/hatch_build.py
!src/**
!evals/corpora/recall_pass_corpus.json
!integrations/opencode/**
!docker/**
# Local installs under allowed trees.
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
